 he  tried to kill wu lin even though he was  just a kid foo laughs at his fate  thinking that the fortune teller was  right all along he fires at wulin but  this time jiang lee stops him he is  tired of being a pawn in foosa legal  activities he claims that he wants to  fight wulin and give him a chance to  showcase the power of the 108 kicks they  get into yet another battle where jiang  li has an upper hand because of the  strength magnifying gloves he is wearing  as the fight proceeds wulan slowly  starts to overpower him but when jiang  li is about to be defeated fu shoots him  dead with his final breath he asks wulin  to live on and maintain the legacy of  the iron feet clan now only wulin and  phu are the ones left alive seeing his  death right in front of him foo tries to  make amends with wulan but his attempt  fails wulin launches at him ready to end  his life but decides otherwise he is  always fought fairly and killing the  opponent is against the master's rule he  doesn't want to swoop down to fu's level  so he lets him be with his ruined  business in the last scene we see wulin  spreading jangly's ashes in the air the  moral of the story today is that fortune  tellers are full of [ __ ]  subscribe for more videos like this turn  on notifications and leave a like to  help the channel out thank you for  watching


